## More about GitHub

-   Once you create free account, you can learn more about
    how it works in this
    [tutorial](https://docs.GitHub.com/en/get-started/quickstart/hello-world){target="_blank"}.

-   Collaborative coding is common on GitHub but is a little
    more complex than working on a shared drive.

    -   Developers of games, R packages, other software,
